      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh im actually losing it. staring at this efficiency paper and if the last few runs don't back up the hypothesis i think i'm just gonna have to pull the whole thing and talk to my advisor about starting over... which would be a total disaster for my graduation timeline. can u just do me a huge favor and look over the last 5 test runs for the low-power runs? i just need to know if accuracy stayed stable or if it's looking as bad as i think it is. i really need some good news right now lol.",
